// An `if` that gives a text, one branch a text made with "{value}" (of a
// capacity of its own): the other branch's text is not cut to that, in a
// fn's result, a `let` and a text of a capacity.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/if_texts.ent > %t.out 2>&1
// RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t.out --match-full-lines

